{"version":1,"content":"<p>【屏幕災情】Apple 首款摺疊智能手機 iPhone Duo 才剛開賣，全球已經傳出大量摺疊屏幕「爆 Mon」災情。</p><p>有分析師發現爆裂位置近乎完全相同，經交叉比對內部結構與損壞點後，推斷極可能是鉸鏈（Hinge）內部的機械結構在展開時對面板造成異常衝擊所致。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:09.515618+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:54:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T22:18:06.220609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:12.626506+00:00","content_hash":"da14d8c98f62f02b8b92e86a74a7f8fafab770ccb60bf4c8b01c0b6fd5c626a8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}